{"id":"bfe810351301dc7b","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-local-reflection.md","title":"Local Reflection Sentences","display":"df-local-reflection — Local Reflection Sentences","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-local-reflection","aliases":["67-df-local-reflection"],"display":"df-local-reflection — Local Reflection Sentences","depends_on":["[[67-df-formula]]","[[67-df-sentence]]","[[67-df-provability-predicate]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_chapter":4,"source_label":"local reflection Rfn_S","source_printed_pages":"52","source_pdf_pages":"63","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","inherited_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"定义陈述已核对；不涉及定理证明","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14","inherited_eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-local-reflection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-local-reflection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-local-reflection — Local Reflection Sentences"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6a4c234306a0ec0c\" href=\"?note=6a4c234306a0ec0c\" title=\"67-df-provability-predicate\">67-df-provability-predicate</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"source_label","html":"local reflection Rfn_S"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"52"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"63"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"定义陈述已核对；不涉及定理证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"inherited_eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 采用固定原始递归公理呈示和标准证明算术化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> 是固定自然句法编号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> 是标准数词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6a4c234306a0ec0c\" href=\"?note=6a4c234306a0ec0c\" title=\"67-df-provability-predicate\">67-df-provability-predicate</a> 的对象语言公式，句子集取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LRefl}_T:\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{LRefl}_T:\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是下式定义的句法构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)\\)</span> 为这些句子的集合，不是一个元语言真假谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> 的指定代码变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v]\">\\(P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LRefl}_g(P,\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{LRefl}_g(P,\\varphi)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RLoc}_g(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{RLoc}_g(P)\\)</span> 是保留证明表示参数的句法构造，代入取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LRefl}_g(P,\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(P[\\overline{g(\\varphi)}/v]\\to\\varphi\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RLoc}_g(P)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{LRefl}_g(P,\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{LRefl}_T(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LRefl}_g(\\mathrm{Prov}_T,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{RLoc}_g(\\mathrm{Prov}_T).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LRefl}_g(P,\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(P[\\overline{g(\\varphi)}/v]\\to\\varphi\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RLoc}_g(P)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{LRefl}_g(P,\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{LRefl}_T(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LRefl}_g(\\mathrm{Prov}_T,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{RLoc}_g(\\mathrm{Prov}_T).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条的原书页码及既往核对记录继承自输入档案；本轮未提供原书 PDF，这些记录不表示本轮重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>对应原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rfn}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Rfn}_T\\)</span>。反思实例是句子本身，不能像旧稿那样把句法构造与一个未指明层级的双条件谓词混写。代码进入对象公式时使用数词。</p>\n<p>每个句子分别给一个实例；这里没有使用在算术中不可定义的全体真句谓词。来源印刷页 52 定义已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"6a4c234306a0ec0c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"6a4c234306a0ec0c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)$ 是 [[67-df-provability-predicate]] 的对象语言公式，句子集取 [[67-df-sentence]]。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)$ 是 [[67-df-provability-predicate]] 的对象语言公式，句子集取 [[67-df-sentence]]。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$v$ 为 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ 的指定代码变量；$P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v]$。$\\mathrm{LRefl}_g(P,\\varphi)$ 与 $\\mathrm{RLoc}_g(P)$ 是保留证明表示参数的句法构造，代入取 [[67-df-formula]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LRefl}_T:\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LRefl}_g(P,\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RLoc}_g(P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LRefl}_g(P,\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(P[\\overline{g(\\varphi)}/v]\\to\\varphi\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RLoc}_g(P)&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{LRefl}_g(P,\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{LRefl}_T(\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LRefl}_g(\\mathrm{Prov}_T,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{RLoc}_g(\\mathrm{Prov}_T).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rfn}_T","display":false}],"bytes":2621,"backlinks":[{"id":"045076ed5daf4d97","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LRefl}_g$、$\\mathrm{RLoc}_g$ 取 [[67-df-local-reflection]]。本条的初始证明公式固定为 $\\mathrm{Prov}_S=\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_S}$；第 $n$ 阶基础 $S\\cup R_n(S)$ 使用下式唯一生成的公理公式 $\\alpha_n$。"},{"id":"675f186aa60d7fbc","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 是原始递归呈示，采用固定标准证明算术化和局部反思句集 $\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)$（[[67-df-local-reflection]]）。"},{"id":"63d809770775f636","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)$、$\\mathrm{Con}^{\\omega}(T)$、$\\Pi_1$ 分别取 [[67-df-local-reflection]]、[[67-df-iterated-consistency]]、[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]。"},{"id":"8e071baceea3f74c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(S)$ 取 [[67-df-local-reflection]]；$\\mathrm{EssInfinite}(T,S)$ 取 [